            "review_title": "Review at V-senses Dining",
            "review_text": "Debbie R\n8 contributions\n0\nQuality, service and good, a must place to go before leaving Vietnam.\nFeb 2026 • Couples\nThe service was impeccable. \nThe quality of food was excellent. The vegetables were so fresh, and I felt like I was back in the flower gardens on the Mekong river. \nNot only the quality of food was very good, but well presented.\nOver the past few weeks I have travelled around Vietnam, and this exceeded all eateries we visited.\nIt’s a shame I am leaving the country tomorrow.\nRead more\nWritten February 8, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
